# Architecture

- Frontend lives in `frontend/` (React 19 + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind v4)
- Backend lives in `backend/app/` (Python 3.12 FastAPI + SQLAlchemy + Alembic)
- Combined container: FastAPI serves `/api` and the built SPA from one origin
- Persistence: SQLite under `DATA_DIR` (`./data` local, `/data` deployed)
- Scale: exactly one replica and one Uvicorn worker while SQLite is used
- Follow `docs/target-architecture.md` and ADRs under `docs/decisions/`
- Prefer vertical slices that replace one mocked screen at a time
